{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain, attention! A clan of nomadic underground dwarves seeks a commander for their drilling train\u2014the Great Machine that burrows into the earth\u2019s depths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your courage and organizational skills are the last hope for fulfilling the dwarves\u2019 cherished dream: to find the lost city and reclaim their home. Join the crew and prove that even in the darkest depths, a spark of hope can ignite!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble a Team and Coordinate Operations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crew member has unique skills that affect efficiency in different compartments and the success of expeditions. Assign tasks wisely, build production chains, and manage logistics. Stay vigilant\u2014resource shortages can halt production and jeopardize the mission.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/00afe03f5b6ab1f258cd79537aa8a673.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/00afe03f5b6ab1f258cd79537aa8a673.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/00afe03f5b6ab1f258cd79537aa8a673.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Handle Crises on the Go</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip the train with new compartments and wagons to ensure constant, rapid movement and uninterrupted production. Repair breakdowns, extinguish fires, fix accidents, and tackle countless other issues to keep the crew alive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/beaf9eb1fee0e7cfe10015cebb2a56ed.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/beaf9eb1fee0e7cfe10015cebb2a56ed.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/beaf9eb1fee0e7cfe10015cebb2a56ed.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on Expeditions, Fulfill Contracts, and Gather Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete traders\u2019 tasks, outfit expeditions, and go on raids to mine rare materials for construction and upgrades. Assemble squads, meet deadlines, and assist scouts with challenges to lead the team to success.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/a5fd9ca77b5de9d3d37f7df27d7dd4ed.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/a5fd9ca77b5de9d3d37f7df27d7dd4ed.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/a5fd9ca77b5de9d3d37f7df27d7dd4ed.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conduct Research and Upgrade Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritize developing your own technologies. Invest resources, materials, and funds not only in buying components but also in creating new machines, crafting unique recipes, and modernizing equipment. This ensures self-sufficiency, adaptability to changing conditions, and greatly expands your capabilities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/6e163becc75bd3532fc7159a7e68aee9.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/6e163becc75bd3532fc7159a7e68aee9.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/6e163becc75bd3532fc7159a7e68aee9.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Relics to Enhance the Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire special artifacts\u2014relics\u2014by completing traders\u2019 contracts, embarking on expeditions, and going on raids. Integrate them into the train\u2019s structure to boost its performance and build the Great Machine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/8f2440c972b297017d7a08454dda5e38.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/8f2440c972b297017d7a08454dda5e38.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/8f2440c972b297017d7a08454dda5e38.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Biomes and Find Valuable Materials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter new biomes along the way, from petrified wastelands to fiery lava depths. Complete tasks, explore new territories, and gather unique materials essential for survival and progress.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/e5a2893bc5c7df1d347e9690da900487.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/e5a2893bc5c7df1d347e9690da900487.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/e5a2893bc5c7df1d347e9690da900487.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2572590?t=1768485080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/5cdc61df88d51f41ea1e9440ddcbc00b1d012c47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768485080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/4a97700cec4a985cb6dc51cca92203c6b8aaa103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768485080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/4a97700cec4a985cb6dc51cca92203c6b8aaa103/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768485080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Expedition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/5fdbdcc3bcca173efd6ccedb72d527c8.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/5fdbdcc3bcca173efd6ccedb72d527c8.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/5fdbdcc3bcca173efd6ccedb72d527c8.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain, attention! A clan of nomadic underground dwarves seeks a commander for their drilling train\u2014the Great Machine that burrows into the earth\u2019s depths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your courage and organizational skills are the last hope for fulfilling the dwarves\u2019 cherished dream: to find the lost city and reclaim their home. Join the crew and prove that even in the darkest depths, a spark of hope can ignite!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble a Team and Coordinate Operations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crew member has unique skills that affect efficiency in different compartments and the success of expeditions. Assign tasks wisely, build production chains, and manage logistics. Stay vigilant\u2014resource shortages can halt production and jeopardize the mission.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/00afe03f5b6ab1f258cd79537aa8a673.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/00afe03f5b6ab1f258cd79537aa8a673.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/00afe03f5b6ab1f258cd79537aa8a673.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Handle Crises on the Go</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip the train with new compartments and wagons to ensure constant, rapid movement and uninterrupted production. Repair breakdowns, extinguish fires, fix accidents, and tackle countless other issues to keep the crew alive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/beaf9eb1fee0e7cfe10015cebb2a56ed.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/beaf9eb1fee0e7cfe10015cebb2a56ed.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/beaf9eb1fee0e7cfe10015cebb2a56ed.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on Expeditions, Fulfill Contracts, and Gather Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete traders\u2019 tasks, outfit expeditions, and go on raids to mine rare materials for construction and upgrades. Assemble squads, meet deadlines, and assist scouts with challenges to lead the team to success.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/a5fd9ca77b5de9d3d37f7df27d7dd4ed.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/a5fd9ca77b5de9d3d37f7df27d7dd4ed.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/a5fd9ca77b5de9d3d37f7df27d7dd4ed.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conduct Research and Upgrade Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritize developing your own technologies. Invest resources, materials, and funds not only in buying components but also in creating new machines, crafting unique recipes, and modernizing equipment. This ensures self-sufficiency, adaptability to changing conditions, and greatly expands your capabilities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/6e163becc75bd3532fc7159a7e68aee9.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/6e163becc75bd3532fc7159a7e68aee9.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/6e163becc75bd3532fc7159a7e68aee9.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Relics to Enhance the Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire special artifacts\u2014relics\u2014by completing traders\u2019 contracts, embarking on expeditions, and going on raids. Integrate them into the train\u2019s structure to boost its performance and build the Great Machine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/8f2440c972b297017d7a08454dda5e38.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/8f2440c972b297017d7a08454dda5e38.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/8f2440c972b297017d7a08454dda5e38.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Biomes and Find Valuable Materials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter new biomes along the way, from petrified wastelands to fiery lava depths. Complete tasks, explore new territories, and gather unique materials essential for survival and progress.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/e5a2893bc5c7df1d347e9690da900487.poster.avif?t=1768485080\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/e5a2893bc5c7df1d347e9690da900487.webm?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/extras/e5a2893bc5c7df1d347e9690da900487.mp4?t=1768485080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Funzen Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572590/c4050c085dd300acc746cc8a0f366e0a9e3aa38f/header.jpg?t=1768485080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572590/1874504770/d0013d70447f420d3b4642fb351cda504a242976/1765288602/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765289556","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572590/1874504770/d0013d70447f420d3b4642fb351cda504a242976/1765288602/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765289556","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572590/1874504770/d0013d70447f420d3b4642fb351cda504a242976/1765288602/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765289556","id":257222035,"name":"Playtest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222035/603a4679784e6f22e7f8762c8d490ca1e47c2f34/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765289556"}],"name":"Underground Nomads","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<